//!
//! The recogniser name, pattern name and regex text are copied from the 2.2.363 sources; the
//! entity decides the sensitivity, category and validator exactly as `rules_presidio.py` does.
//! Duplicate regex texts across recognisers are dropped, as in the Python loader.

